      "exact_quote": "Required Action(s) and Compliance Time(s):\n     Required as indicated by this AD, unless the action              (s) required by this AD have been already\n     accomplished:\n\n     Modification:\n     (1)   Within 30 days after the effective date           of this AD, relocate the IFE BinBox in accordance              with\n           the instructions of the      DCS.",
